Rather than add an entirely new item, why not modify the existing dwarvish 
iron helm?  It already has the 'hard hat' appearance.

If worn and (a)pplied, it would give light.  The light would last 499-749 
turns (for comparison, brass lantern lasts 999-1499), after which you would 
need to charge it or get a new one.  If you removed it, it would still burn 
but not generate light.

If it becomes very rusty or thoroughly rusty, the helm should lose all charge 
and become unrechargeable (the battery is shorted out).   There should also 
be a chance of it exploding and damaging you, based on Luck.

I would reduce the AC from to 1 to make up for the light, and improve the 
helmet/kabuto AC to 2 so that there would still be an AC:2 helm.

